WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.625
Nerves are fast and targeted; hormones are slower, travel in the blood and last longer.

2
00:00:06.326 --> 00:00:10.126
A nerve signal and a hormone, released at the same moment.

3
00:00:13.685 --> 00:00:16.835
The nerve impulse arrives first, at one muscle.

4
00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:21.986
The hormone travels in the blood: slower, but it reaches many organs.
